{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33351","headline":"婕妤怨 · 翁绶","name":"婕妤怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谗谤潜来起百忧，朝承恩宠暮仇雠。\n火烧白玉非因玷，霜剪红兰不待秋。\n花落昭阳谁共辇，月明长信独登楼。\n繁华事逐东流水，团扇悲歌万古愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}